# Legacy mod_auth_form gate REMOVED 2026-08-09 (console unification, Slice 2).
# Deployed to: /opt/app/lamp/www/docs/{assets,img,cases,f2}/.htaccess
#
# The stanza that lived here authenticated against the retired .htpasswd-docs /
# uhcsess3 session, so every post-cutover account got 401 on this directory
# while pre-cutover browsers (still holding the old cookie) sailed through —
# dashboard charts and map styling silently broken for NEW users only, which is
# why nobody saw it on 2026-08-08.
#
# Access is enforced at the edge instead: nginx auth_request -> authz.php ->
# acl.php, deny-by-default (assets/img: AUTH; cases/f2: case.view). This file
# stays in place so the directory is never mistaken for ungated; add rules here
# only for things Apache alone must do. Originals preserved at
# /root/htaccess-backups-20260809/ on the box.
